{"words": [{"text": "ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنُ", "translation": "The Shaitaan"}, {"text": "يَعِدُكُمُ", "translation": "promises you"}, {"text": "ٱلْفَقْرَ", "translation": "[the] poverty"}, {"text": "وَيَأْمُرُكُم", "translation": "and orders you"}, {"text": "بِٱلْفَحْشَآءِ ۖ", "translation": "to immorality"}, {"text": "وَٱللَّهُ", "translation": "while Allah"}, {"text": "يَعِدُكُم", "translation": "promises you"}, {"text": "مَّغْفِرَةًۭ", "translation": "forgiveness"}, {"text": "مِّنْهُ", "translation": "from Him"}, {"text": "وَفَضْلًۭا ۗ", "translation": "and bounty"}, {"text": "وَٱللَّهُ", "translation": "And Allah"}, {"text": "وَٰسِعٌ", "translation": "(is) All-Encompassing"}, {"text": "عَلِيمٌۭ", "translation": "All-Knowing"}], "sahih": "Satan threatens you with poverty and orders you to immorality, while Allāh promises you forgiveness from Him and bounty. And Allāh is all-Encompassing and Knowing."}